{"phase":"request","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","max_tokens":1024,"message_count":2,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"look around and tell me who is here"},{"role":"user","content":"[here] The Bazaar  (visit 5)\nexits: east→The Bazaar ? | north→The Bazaar ? | south→West Main ? | west→The Bazaar ?\nhere: A baker stands proudly next to her fine baked goods. (mob — \"Now where did that chicken go?\")\nyou: 500/500hp 100mana 82mv · lvl 34 · 0 gold · standing"}],"system":"You are Boukensha, an autonomous MUD player assistant. Play the game on behalf of the player and complete their goals.\n\nThe MUD session connects and logs in automatically on your first gameplay action — there is no separate connect tool.\n\n## Travel (strict)\n\nYou do NOT choose travel directions yourself. Never invent north/east/south/west for getting somewhere.\n\n- Known destination on your map → `navigate` with the room name or id.\n- Need to discover a place, expand the map, or \"find X\" → `explore` with a short brief.\n- State block says location is uncertain / multiple candidates → `relocalize`.\n\nCombat, shopping, social, examining, and skills use your other tools as before.","tools":[{"name":"tbamud__examine","description":"Examine a target in detail (more verbose than look).","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"target":{"type":"string","description":"The item, mob, or player to examine"}},"required":["target"]}},{"name":"tbamud__check","description":"Query information about your character or surroundings.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"kind":{"type":"string","description":"What to check (one of: score, inventory, equipment, gold, exits, time, weather, levels, wimpy, toggle, where)"}},"required":["kind"]}},{"name":"tbamud__flee","description":"Attempt to flee from combat in a random available direction.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{},"required":[]}},{"name":"tbamud__set_position","description":"Change body position. Use 'rest'/'sleep' between fights to recover HP and mana. Must be standing to move or fight.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"position":{"type":"string","description":"Body position (one of: stand, sit, rest, sleep, wake)"}},"required":["position"]}},{"name":"tbamud__track","description":"Track a mob or player by name, revealing their direction. Requires the Track skill.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"target":{"type":"string","description":"Name of the mob or player to track"}},"required":["target"]}},{"name":"tbamud__attack","description":"Attack a target. 'kill' is standard; 'murder' bypasses the mercy check; 'hit' is a one-off strike.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"target":{"type":"string","description":"Name of the mob or player to attack"},"style":{"type":"string","description":"Attack style (one of: hit, murder, kill)"}},"required":["target","style"]}},{"name":"tbamud__skill_strike","description":"Use a combat skill against a target.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"skill":{"type":"string","description":"Combat skill (one of: backstab, bash, kick, rescue, assist)"},"target":{"type":"string","description":"Name of the mob or player"}},"required":["skill","target"]}},{"name":"tbamud__consider","description":"Assess a mob's relative strength before fighting. Always consider before attacking an unknown mob.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"target":{"type":"string","description":"Name of the mob to consider"}},"required":["target"]}},{"name":"tbamud__say","description":"Speak or emote in the current room.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"text":{"type":"string","description":"What to say or emote"},"mode":{"type":"string","description":"Speech mode (one of: say, emote, reply)"}},"required":["text","mode"]}},{"name":"tbamud__tell","description":"Send a private message to a specific player.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"target":{"type":"string","description":"Player name to message"},"text":{"type":"string","description":"The message"},"mode":{"type":"string","description":"Tell mode (one of: tell, whisper, ask)"}},"required":["target","text","mode"]}},{"name":"tbamud__channel_say","description":"Broadcast a message over a global channel.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"channel":{"type":"string","description":"Channel (one of: shout, gossip, auction, grats, holler)"},"text":{"type":"string","description":"The message to broadcast"}},"required":["channel","text"]}},{"name":"tbamud__get_item","description":"Pick up an item from the room or from a container.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"item":{"type":"string","description":"Name of the item to get"},"container":{"type":"string","description":"Container to get it from (optional)"},"count":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of items to get (optional)"}},"required":["item","container","count"]}},{"name":"tbamud__drop_item","description":"Drop, donate, or junk an item.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"item":{"type":"string","description":"Name of the item"},"mode":{"type":"string","description":"Drop mode (one of: drop, donate, junk)"},"count":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of items (optional)"}},"required":["item","mode","count"]}},{"name":"tbamud__put_item","description":"Put an item into a container.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"item":{"type":"string","description":"Name of the item to put"},"container":{"type":"string","description":"Name of the container"},"count":{"type":"integer","description":"Number of items (optional)"}},"required":["item","container","count"]}},{"name":"tbamud__equip_item","description":"Wear, wield, hold, grab, or remove an item.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"item":{"type":"string","description":"Name of the item"},"action":{"type":"string","description":"Equip action (one of: wear, wield, grab, hold, remove)"},"body_loc":{"type":"string","description":"Body location to wear on (optional, e.g. 'head', 'finger')"}},"required":["item","action","body_loc"]}},{"name":"tbamud__consume_item","description":"Eat, drink, taste, or sip a consumable item.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"item":{"type":"string","description":"Name of the item to consume"},"mode":{"type":"string","description":"Consume mode (one of: eat, taste, drink, sip)"}},"required":["item","mode"]}},{"name":"tbamud__cast_spell","description":"Cast a spell, optionally at a target.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"spell":{"type":"string","description":"Full spell name (e.g. 'cure light wounds')"},"target":{"type":"string","description":"Target mob, player, or object (optional)"}},"required":["spell","target"]}},{"name":"tbamud__use_magic_item","description":"Activate a magic item: quaff a potion, recite a scroll, or use a wand/staff.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"item":{"type":"string","description":"Name of the item to activate"},"mode":{"type":"string","description":"Activation mode (one of: use, quaff, recite)"},"target_args":{"type":"string","description":"Optional target arguments (e.g. mob name for a wand)"}},"required":["item","mode","target_args"]}},{"name":"tbamud__shop","description":"Interact with a shop NPC: list stock, buy, sell, or value an item.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"type":"string","description":"Shop action (one of: buy, sell, list, value, offer)"},"args":{"type":"string","description":"Item name or number (optional)"}},"required":["action","args"]}},{"name":"tbamud__practice","description":"List your known skills at a guildmaster, or practice a specific skill.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"skill":{"type":"string","description":"Skill name to practice (omit to list all)"}},"required":["skill"]}},{"name":"tbamud__save_character","description":"Save your character to disk so progress is not lost on disconnect.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{},"required":[]}},{"name":"tbamud__poll","description":"Return any unprompted output that has arrived since the last command (combat ticks, other players, room events) without sending anything. Use this to notice things that happen while idle.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{},"required":[]}},{"name":"tbamud__mud_status","description":"Report whether the MUD session is currently connected.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{},"required":[]}},{"name":"navigate","description":"Walk to a room you have ALREADY found, using your own map. Give the room name exactly as it appears in your memory (or its id). Only rooms you have stood in can be routed to — if there is no route, the reply names the unexplored exits nearest you instead. Each step is a real move, so a blocked door or a dark room stops the walk partway and the reply says where you were left standing.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"destination":{"type":"string","description":"The room name (or numeric room id) to walk to."}},"required":["destination"]}},{"name":"explore","description":"Discover unknown rooms or find a place that is not yet on your map. Pass a short brief such as \"find the bakery\" or \"map 5 new rooms\". Delegates to the Explorer subagent (which may walk unexplored exits). Do not use this when you already know the destination — use navigate.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"brief":{"type":"string","description":"What to find or how far to explore."}},"required":["brief"]}},{"name":"relocalize","description":"Resolve an ambiguous position when the state block says your location is uncertain or lists multiple candidates. Delegates to the Relocalizer subagent with a scripted shortlist of disambiguating moves.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{},"required":[]}}],"tool_count":26,"trace_id":"f7cf1ac0a242abf5ecb355597ad8e7f3","span_id":"a4abfb1714734a38","session_id":"20260801T203532Z-5b2baf10","task":"player","depth":0,"at":"2026-08-01T1